## Output Format

Return your extraction as a JSON object matching the ACMExtractionResult schema with:
- `records`: Array of ALL extracted ACM records (both positive AND negative results, but NOT "None" hazard type items)
- `status`: "valid" if extraction succeeded, "no_acm_data" if content has no ACM records
- `extraction_notes`: Any important observations about the extraction

### Required Fields for Each Record

- `building_id`: Building identifier (e.g., "B009" for SAMP, or building name for ARA)
- `product`: Product/element type (e.g., "Floor Coverings", "Eaves", "Wall")
- `material_description`: Material description (e.g., "Vinyl Tiles", "Flat Cement Sheeting")
- `result`: Test result using BAR vocabulary: "Positive", "Assumed Positive", "Negative", or "Assumed Negative"
- `extraction_confidence`: Confidence level ("high", "medium", or "low")

### Highly Recommended Fields (extract if available)

- `sample_result`: "Positive", "Assumed Positive", "Negative", or "Assumed Negative"
- `sample_no`: Sample identification number
- `room_id`: Room identifier (e.g., "R0005" for SAMP, or null for ARA)
- `room_name`: Room name (e.g., "General Storeroom", "Boiler Room", "External")
- `room_area`: Room area (e.g., "1.45 m2")
- `extent`: Extent of material (e.g., "2m2", "20m2")
- `location`: Location within room (e.g., "Throughout", "Under sink")
- `friable`: "Non-friable" or "Friable"
- `material_condition`: Condition of material
- `disturbance_potential`: Likelihood of disturbance
- `risk_status`: Risk level (Low/Moderate/High)
- `area_type`: "Interior" or "Exterior"
- `page_number`: Page number where this record was found (use {{ page_number }} for records in this chunk)
- `hygienist_recommendations`: Control/management recommendations
- `data_issues`: List of any extraction concerns
